<ttl id="1002B_S001H_74Y0X_T00H8" variety="T00H8">
<name>Electronically Controlled Automatic Transaxle [ECT] (U660E)</name>
<para id="RM000000AVQ011X" category="C" type-id="302NM" name-id="261IF-00" from="200708">
<dtccode>P2759/68</dtccode>
<dtcname>Lock-up Solenoid</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000000AVQ011X_01" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FRO00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The transmission control computer controls the lock-up solenoid to the specified duty ratio to perform lock-up and flex lock-up.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.14in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.94in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
<ptxt>SAE/TCCS</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
<ptxt>1. Detection condition 2. Malfunction status 3. Malfunction duration 4. Other</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>P2759/68</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Engine running</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Open or short in solenoid SLU circuit</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Continuously for 1 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>1 trip</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Transmission wire</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Lock-up Control Solenoid (SLU)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Transmission Control Computer Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000000AVQ011X_02" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FRP00000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C173977J03" width="7.106578999in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000000AVQ011X_03" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000000AVQ011X_04" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000000AVQ011X_04_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FRQ00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Transmission Wire (SLU)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Remove the transmission control computer. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000024M9003X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C133212J18" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.96in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.08in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.09in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>11(SLU+) - 5(SLU-)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>20°C</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>5.0 to 5.6Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance of the terminals.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.96in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.08in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.09in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>11 (SLU+) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>1M Ω or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000AVQ011X_04_0008" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000000AVQ011X_04_0003" fin="false">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000AVQ011X_04_0008" proc-id="RM0550J___0000HCM00000">
<testtitle>Replace Transmission Control Computer Assembly</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Replace the transmission control computer assembly. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000024M8003X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000AVQ011X_04_0009" fin="true">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000AVQ011X_04_0009">
<testtitle>A/T Unit Compensation<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000OLY013X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000AVQ011X_04_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FRR00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Lock-up Control Solenoid (SLU)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect the lock-up control solenoid (SLU) connector.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), check the resistance between the terminals.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.96in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.08in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.09in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Terminal 1 - Terminal 2</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>20°C</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>5.0 to 5.6Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000AVQ011X_04_0007" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000000AVQ011X_04_0006" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000AVQ011X_04_0007">
<testtitle>Repair or Replace Transmission Wire<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000002BOQ004X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000AVQ011X_04_0006">
<testtitle>Replace Lock-up Control Solenoid (SLU)</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
